Bitmap-style fonts used by the Undertow interface.

chikarego2.woff2
  ChiKareGo2 by Giles Booth (blogmywiki), a recreation of Susan Kare's
  Chicago 12. Made with BitFontMaker2 and published under a Creative Commons
  Attribution licence. Copy taken from system.css (MIT) by Sakun Acharige.

geneva-9.ttf
  Geneva 9 by Kelsey Higham, https://fontstruct.com/fontstructions/show/349277/geneva_9
  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0, http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
  (licence recorded in the font's own name table). Copy taken from system.css.

The original Chicago and Geneva typefaces belong to Apple and are not included.
